column7:
 Pramod Kumar Chaudhary | 31 | Male |  SC | Rajbhar

- Incumbent Mukhiya (2016,2021-Present) 
-  Runner-up BDC (2016}

- Business setup in Noorsarai
- Brother BDC member - Damora (Noorsarai);
-Closely works with Shravan Kumar(Gramin Vikas Mantri)

- Ex Sarpanch of Salehpur(2006-2016); defacto Sarpanch (2006-2011) when the seat got reserved for women.
- Ward member (2001- Present); has worked with all the Mukhiyas since 2001 in different capacities;
- Well versed with panchayat politics; Farmer witth land in Kachra
- Active, can mobilise community;

